        f"{int(KNIGHT_TAX_RATE*100)}%i <b>{knight['house']}</b> ga soliq sifatida to'lanadi.\n"
        f"🏰 O'zingizga qal'a qurib (🏗 Qasrni yuksaltirish bo'limidan, "
        f"{KNIGHT_CASTLE_COST} tanga) to'liq C darajali lordga aylanishingiz mumkin — "
        f"shunda <b>{knight['house']}</b> ga emas, balki hudud lordiga (boshqa C toifali "
        f"oilalar kabi kuniga {TAX_RATE['C']} tanga) soliq to'laysiz.\n"
